otengine/godot/issues/114813","id":3935251091,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qjyqT","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T14:34:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T14:34:44Z","body":"> Well, one data point for a frequent usage use case: we used translation keys instead of final English text for Rift Riff\r\n\r\nDo the translators for other languages get the source strings from elsewhere? Sounds like unnecessary attrition. POT files are generally the ones that contain those for a reason.\r\n\r\n> If \"About Godot...\" is in command palette, I don't think this argument is relevant.\r\n\r\nI see that as an argument for it having too much junk, actually. :stuck_out_tongue:\r\n\r\n> If anything, we should have more of them.\r\n\r\nEhhh, I don't think that shoving everything _plus_ the kitchen sink in there is a good idea. It slowly starts to pollute the palette, hurting usability.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3935251091/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laug